        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite</strong> Borrowed Nature</p><hr /><p>You may <strong>Don the Other Face</strong> twice per encounter, and your Aspect deepens:</p><ul><li><strong>Soul Reaper's Discipline</strong> &mdash; you learn a <strong>second</strong> kid&#333;, and while the Face is on your <strong>destruction</strong> kid&#333; deal one additional die of damage.</li><li><strong>Hollow's Mask</strong> &mdash; temporary Hit Points equal to <strong>twice</strong> your level, resistance equal to <strong>half</strong> your level, and the Speed bonus increases to <strong>+10 feet</strong>.</li><li><strong>Quincy's Discipline</strong> &mdash; Blut Vene's resistance becomes <strong>half</strong> your level, and once per encounter while the Face is on you may use <strong>Seal the Art</strong>, even though you are not a Quincy.</li></ul>"
